种</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%96%b0%e5%86%a0%e7%97%85%e6%af%92%e6%98%af%e5%90%a6%e6%94%b9%e5%8f%98%e4%ba%86%e6%88%91%e4%bb%ac%e7%9a%84%e6%83%af%e6%80%a7%e6%80%9d%e7%bb%b4.assets/640-1681782158122-154.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>新冠疫情</category><category>疫情危害</category><category>新冠知识及就诊 Covid Insights &amp; Consultation</category><category>新冠知多少 Covid Insights</category></item><item><title>解密新冠死亡病因</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%AF%86%E6%96%B0%E5%86%A0%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%97%85%E5%9B%A0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Tue, 26 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/%E8%A7%A3%E5%AF%86%E6%96%B0%E5%86%A0%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E7%97%85%E5%9B%A0/</guid><description>德国病理学家、汉堡大学法医研究所所长Klaus Püschel教授的团队对192个死者尸体做了解剖。尸检结果发现很多死者身上有血栓（血液凝块）</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e8%a7%a3%e5%af%86%e6%96%b0%e5%86%a0%e6%ad%bb%e4%ba%a1%e7%97%85%e5%9b%a0.assets/image-20230501215848772.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>新冠疫情</category><category>疫情危害</category><category>新冠死亡病因</category><category>新冠知识及就诊 Covid Insights &amp; Consultation</category><category>新冠知多少 Covid Insights</category></item><item><title>新冠病毒肺炎危害到底有多大?</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/%E6%96%B0%E5%86%A0%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E5%8D%B1%E5%AE%B3%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%A7/</link><pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Sat, 16 May 2020 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/posts/%E6%96%B0%E5%86%A0%E7%97%85%E6%AF%92%E8%82%BA%E7%82%8E%E5%8D%B1%E5%AE%B3%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E6%9C%89%E5%A4%9A%E5%A4%A7/</guid><description>全世界可能会有上百万人，甚至更多，他们的余生将需要诸如肾透析这样的治疗。我们对冠状病毒和它所带来的疾病了解得越多，越详实；问题就越复杂、越纠</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e6%96%b0%e5%86%a0%e7%97%85%e6%af%92%e8%82%ba%e7%82%8e%e5%8d%b1%e5%ae%b3%e5%88%b0%e5%ba%95%e6%9c%89%e5%a4%9a%e5%a4%a7%ef%bc%9f.assets/image-20230303154031845.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>新冠疫情</category><category>疫情危害</category><category>新冠知识及就诊 Covid Insights &amp; Consultation</category><category>新冠知多少 Covid Insights</category></item></channel></rss>